  "christianAffirmation3": "\"The Lord is my shepherd; I shall not want.\"\n- Psalm 23:1",
  "muslimAffirmation1": "\"So verily, with the hardship, there is relief.\"\n- Quran 94:6",
  "muslimAffirmation2": "\"And He found you lost and guided [you].\"\n- Quran 93:7",
  "muslimAffirmation3": "\"Indeed, Allah is with the patient.\"\n- Quran 2:153",
  "traditionalistAffirmation1": "Your ancestors walked through storms and found their way. You carry their strength within you.",
  "traditionalistAffirmation2": "The earth provides in its own time. Trust the natural rhythm of life and your body.",
  "traditionalistAffirmation3": "Community and family are your pillars. Draw strength from those who love you and walk beside you.",
